                    // the SAME interpolation as the per-block DC correction on
                    // top of the warp predictor Pass W wrote, which is the
                    // whole of [SYN] 13.3:
                    //     pred = clamp(W + planar(M) - dc_offset, 0, maxval)
                    // and, for a skipped tile whose mean field is flat at
